<h2 id="portland-kitchen-design-trends">Portland Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Portland kitchens lean Pacific-Northwest modern: natural wood tones, matte finishes, warm neutrals, and an understated aesthetic that reflects the region's emphasis on natural materials. Two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands are popular in the city's many craftsman and mid-century remodels, while higher-end West Hills and Lake Oswego projects favor <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens.</p>
